questions.statement:
Suppose that a computer program provides a non-negative and integer-valued
             random solution to the equation 𝑛1 + 𝑛2 + 𝑛3 + 𝑛4 = 20.

             Which of the following is the probability that all of 𝑛1 , 𝑛2 , 𝑛3 , 𝑛4 in the provided
             solution are positive?

 (A)         (19
              3
                )/(23
                   3
                     )

 (B)         (20
              4
                )/(24
                   4
                     )

 (C)         (20
              3
                )/(23
                   3
                     )

 (D)         (19
              4
                )/(24
                   4
                     )
